{"id":"cc8424d7afc22e4d","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_HilbertConseq.md","title":"HilbertConseq","display":"HilbertConseq","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"HilbertConseq","parameters":["A","R","g","a"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"HilbertConseq"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>A</span><span>R</span><span>g</span><span>a</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：参数化 Hilbert 演算。有序参数：<code>A</code>、<code>R</code>、<code>g</code>、<code>a</code>。</p>\n<p>精确含义以本页公式体及其全部依赖为准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ HilbertConseq A R g a)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(and\n  (@ HilbertParams A R)\n  (and\n    (@ FormsC g)\n    (and\n      (@ FmC a)\n      (forall v\n        (implies (and (@ HilbertCompatible A R v) (forall b (implies (in b g) (@ CSat v b)))) (@ CSat v a))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4fee39837eb328bf\" href=\"?note=4fee39837eb328bf\" title=\"ZFC_CSat\">CSat</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"43d22035e7796b1d\" href=\"?note=43d22035e7796b1d\" title=\"ZFC_FmC\">FmC</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c0c9a9379a527254\" href=\"?note=c0c9a9379a527254\" title=\"ZFC_FormsC\">FormsC</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"dd3ac967350e3362\" href=\"?note=dd3ac967350e3362\" title=\"ZFC_HilbertCompatible\">HilbertCompatible</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"558cfa8109ae83cc\" href=\"?note=558cfa8109ae83cc\" title=\"ZFC_HilbertParams\">HilbertParams</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ HilbertConseq A R g a)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_CSat","status":"resolved","id":"4fee39837eb328bf","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_CSat|CSat]]；[[ZFC_FmC|FmC]]；[[ZFC_FormsC|FormsC]]；[[ZFC_HilbertCompatible|HilbertCompatible]]；[[ZFC_HilbertParams|HilbertParams]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_FmC","status":"resolved","id":"43d22035e7796b1d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_CSat|CSat]]；[[ZFC_FmC|FmC]]；[[ZFC_FormsC|FormsC]]；[[ZFC_HilbertCompatible|HilbertCompatible]]；[[ZFC_HilbertParams|HilbertParams]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_FormsC","status":"resolved","id":"c0c9a9379a527254","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_CSat|CSat]]；[[ZFC_FmC|FmC]]；[[ZFC_FormsC|FormsC]]；[[ZFC_HilbertCompatible|HilbertCompatible]]；[[ZFC_HilbertParams|HilbertParams]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_HilbertCompatible","status":"resolved","id":"dd3ac967350e3362","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_CSat|CSat]]；[[ZFC_FmC|FmC]]；[[ZFC_FormsC|FormsC]]；[[ZFC_HilbertCompatible|HilbertCompatible]]；[[ZFC_HilbertParams|HilbertParams]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_HilbertParams","status":"resolved","id":"558cfa8109ae83cc","anchor":"ref-6","ta